<title>USA: Pentair acquires vehicle service equipment maker.</title>
<headline>Pentair acquires vehicle service equipment maker.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pentair Inc said Monday it acquired Century Manufacturing Co, which designs, manufactures, and markets vehicle service equipment.</p>
<p>The acquisition of Bloomington, Minnesota-based Century included Quebec-based Booster Pac International, a unit of Century that designs, manufactures, and markets portable power supplies, principally for automotive and marine applications.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Pentair is a diversified manufacturer.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
